80
00:07:15,523 --> 00:07:19,556
<i>Pele suave com odor almiscarado</i>

81
00:07:19,602 --> 00:07:23,779
<i>A dama de outra alma sorridente</i>

82
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:26,180
"Belas calças."

83
00:07:26,274 --> 00:07:28,340
<i>Colônia</i>

84
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,997
<i>ela vai usar</i>

85
00:07:31,455 --> 00:07:33,561
